    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "それで……その、プロデューサーさん……\r\nけ、結果は……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花のほうから聞いてくるなんて、珍しいな",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』に、参加できるかなって……考えると……\r\nき、緊張して……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nまぁ、気になるよな",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで結果はだな……\r\n『W.I.N.G.』への参加が決定したよ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え……本当……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当だよ\r\nおめでとう、甜花",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そっか……そう、なんだ……\r\nもっと大きいステージに……立てるんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "やった……にへへ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n甜花の努力の成果だ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ううん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花が……ここまで来れたのは……\r\nプロデューサーさんと、なーちゃんたちのおかげだから……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花……\r\nそんなことはな……",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でもっ、ここからは……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ここからは……誰かに助けてもらわなくても……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花が、自分で……\r\n頑張らなきゃいけないって……思う……っ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな\r\n甜花はもう、ひとりでも頑張れるようになってるもんな",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……それでね……プロデューサーさんには、\r\n甜花が頑張ってるか……見ててほしくて……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そうしたら……きっと……\r\n何かがあっても、頑張れるから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん。甜花が頑張る姿……\r\n最後まで、傍で見てるよ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "最後まで……\r\n甜花が途中で失敗しちゃっても……だよね……？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500107/7015001070140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんだ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001070150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\n約束、だよ……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
